! mcp_bootstrap_p236.strap -- MCP printed page 236: the Input Program's
! TS-B / card-reader / scan tables (VF,0 .. V SC2Q DRZ), lines 1-56.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_001-249.pdf PDF p.243, read at 400 dpi, 900 dpi for
! doubtful glyphs.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP
! CARD ID CA000993  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 236"; the heading
! row's LOCATION field is 225216, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  56 lines.  Located rows run 225216.00 .. 225260.00 (line 56
! is a DRZ(BU,32) of V SCK = 6 half words, printing 000003.00, so the
! next word is 225263.00).  Line 13 is the second field of line 12's
! DD(BU,1),1,0 (same card serial).  Lines 7 and 24 are CNOPs printing
! no location.  Lines 6, 19-23, 27, 46 are SYN cards (location column
! prints the value; NULL or BU,01,10 in the data-description column).
! Asterisks after the LOCATION on lines 5, 18, 39, 54, 56.  The volume
! OCR puts p.235's last row at 225215.40 (a half-word B,V TA), so line 1
! joins it; the scratch p.237 deck opens at SLC 225263.0, joining line 56.
!
! DRZ ROWS print their size in words and get no !CHECK: line 5
! DRZ(BU,32),VTSAK-2 prints 000001.00 (2 x 32 bits), line 18
! DRZ(BU,32),VTSBK prints 000002.00, line 39 DRZ(BU,32),VCRK-1 prints
! 000000.40, line 56 DRZ(BU,32),VSCK prints 000003.00.  Line 5's
! location prints 225217.71: the VF before it at 225217.40 is 25 bits
! long (.40 + 25 bits = .71), and the CNOP on line 7 rounds up again.
!
! "-" IS THE COMMENT MARK.  Lines 30, 31, 49, 50 print
! "V RDX2K-CR2S", "-CR2R", "V SX2K-SC2S", "-SC2R" with no blank.  The
! ' comment mark (8-4 punch; C28-6129, coding-sheet section: "The
! beginning of a comment is signaled by the character '") prints as "-"
! on this drum, and C28-6129's coding hint 2 is to punch it "immediately
! after the last character of the final instruction".  Binary agrees: the XW refill
! fields print 225241 / 225257 = V RDX2K / V SX2K exactly.  CR2S etc.
! name the X2S/X2R entries (VCR+VX2S = 225233, VCR+VX2R = 225234; the
! queue XWs "K XW, Queue, N, K", C22-6728).  Written as remarks.
!
! LABEL SPELLINGS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 19 "V CP" = VOP, line 21 "V CS" = VDS, line 22 "V IO" = VID,
!     line 20 "V SQNC"/"V SGNC" = VSQNC, lines 22/23 "V TQ"/"V TDQ"
!     (tails worn): landed decks spell VOP, VDS (3.40), VSQNC (3.01),
!     VTQ (6.0), VTDQ (6.40); VID is p.213's VNX.VH = 5.40, so
!     VID.VH = 6.00 = line 22's printed value.
!   * line 16 "V TSAQ"/"TSAG" = VTSAQ: landed p.230 label at 224777.00 =
!     the printed address.  Line 17 V TA = landed p.229 VTA 224754.00.
!   * line 34 "V SQ" = VSQ: landed p.218 label 224314.00 (printed).
!   * line 35 "V RDIC" = VRDIO: landed p.216 label 224235.40, B prints
!     224235.50.
!   * line 53 "V EQ" = VEQ: landed p.222 label 224451.40.
!   * lines 10/11/15 "V ISB2"/"V TSB2": T (as line 18's V TSB2 label).
!   * lines 49/50/55/56 "V SC2Q"/"SC2G"/"SC26" = VSC2Q (C22-6728 Fig. 59
!     prints VSC2Q, the SC queue entry).
!   * octal fields "CCCCCC.CC" and hex "C0" are 0; "VF,C"/"XW,C"/"CW,C"
!     are ,0 (each prints a zero value).
!
! CARD SERIALS.  Right-hand serials run ?A000993 .. ?A001041 (prefix
! glyph D-shaped, as in the header's CA000993).  Pairs share a serial:
! lines 1/2 (993), 8/9 (997), 12/13 (1000), 38/39 (1025), 42/43 (1028);
! lines 3/4/5 share 994.  No serial is skipped.  Remark sequence numbers
! -0964 .. -1013, several rows print none; -0997 is never printed
! (line 38 prints none, line 39 -0996, line 40 -0998).

VH      SYN, 32                      ! p.213 line 7 "V H SYN,32", an INTEGER
VID     SYN, (8)5.40                 ! p.213 line 17 (VNX.VH); printed "V IO" here (D worn)
VTSAK   SYN, 4                       ! p.235 "V TSAK SYN,4" (not landed); DRZ line 5 VTSAK-2 prints 000001.00, this page's binary
VTSAQ   SYN(BU,32,8), (8)224777.0    ! landed p.230 label (LVI, half word); B line 16
VTA     SYN(BU,32,8), (8)224754.0    ! landed p.229 label (LX, half word); B line 17
VST     SYN, (8)225312.0             ! landed decks; VF line 14 225312.00+
VREOP   SYN(BU,32,8), (8)224647.0    ! landed p.227 label (LX, half word); B line 25
VRDEE   SYN(BU,32,8), (8)224162.40   ! landed p.215 label (LX, half word); B line 26 .50
